====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# Someone or something who [[bark#Etymology_2|bark]]s.
#: {{ux|en|My neighbor's dog is a constant '''barker''' that keeps me awake at night.}}
# A person employed to [[solicit]] [[customer]]s by calling out to passersby, e.g. at a [[carnival]].
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=2013-06-07|author=David Simpson
|volume=188|issue=26|page=36|magazine={{w|The at high altitudes, there is a carnival '''barker''' with a bevy of pretty girls willing to dangle from a basket or parachute down to earth.}}
