# A [[shelf-talker]].
# {{lb|en|video games}} A video game mode where the action is demonstrated to entice someone to play the game.
#: {{ux|en|The '''barker''' mode of the arcade video game convinced the teenager to spend a quarter.}}
# {{lb|en|slang|dated}} A [[pistol]].
#: {{rfquotek|en|Charles Dickens}}
#* {{quote-book|en|author=George MacDonald Fraser|title=[http://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flashman_(novel) Flashman]|year=1969|page=45|passage=''...Parkin, the Oxford Street gunmaker, sent me a brace of '''barkers''' in silver mountings, with my initials engraved—good for trade, I imagine.''}}
# The spotted [[redshank]].

